# Local STT/TTS model weights (openai-whisper "small", leva-tts -- see
# app/infrastructure/voice_models.py) if ever cached inside the repo instead of the
# libraries' default ~/.cache location. Not expected in normal operation, but guarded
# here defensively since these are gigabyte-scale downloads that must never be committed.
.cache/
model_cache/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

